    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Patricia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114864345219969011634/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLdVnOcm1HZ3mFkmxnyjXj7Qj3fiX0y0EndmvFLKEq7zvjXpKAz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Never met the person called for price , sale of my house,  secretary would not answer any questions said the notary will call u this week, it was a Monday.  Call back finally Wednesday so basically was told by my agent fees are 1000-1400,  this notary was at 2 visits first for min 1.5-2 hrs and second visit I did not ask, she lost me at first visit of 2 hours, like why? Why do I pay and have to be there, now most are doing zoom or phone and once ,done in 20 min. The cost 2100$, fell off my chair, was not ready for that after being told by many the final cost was much less.Found a very professional honest  in business for 30 yrs at total of 1100$. Moving is costly that 1000$ I saved goes to my movers. So Notaire Lamarre  you are overcharging people, you are in an older building nothing fancy, I dislike being taken advantage.  People need to know.",
        "time": 1604536995,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Louis Lafleur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100117570300525426975/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLM9ydQnz4ciDWeAPsfrQL1uQuMMtR3DkMdTxJ4hJ0Xzr_oZQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We have just done business with Chantal Lamarre once again.\nWe can only recommend this notary. In addition to being highly competent, she is kind and available in a way we don't often encounter.\nMs. Lamarre spends a lot of time explaining contracts and wills to us before signing. Incidentally, her rates are very reasonable.\nWe highly recommend her.",
        "time": 1717745994,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "celine pichette",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100940368484646374909/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWe4m5kosuCdyTfV4o5i_JJzpelnXtjWgOXH6EP_8uSS29GZ_E=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I 100% recommend Ms. Chantal Lamarre. She's a gem!! She's been my notary for 14 years; she's always available, personable, and possesses extensive expertise.\nExtremely competent and professional, she answers our questions. She's adept at verbalizing technical formalities and simplifying the understanding of legal terms. Thank you, Ms. Lamarre, for being someone we can always count on! I'm very grateful for all your work, your attentiveness, and your empathy!",
        "time": 1690307491,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maurice Tousignant",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107421372495173972030/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJInTQcuTm2TbGjlHiNJdAJT333zJgpXAwEb04YMZ6z0n6BnQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "It is a great pleasure to be able to rely on Ms. Lamarre's professionalism, thoroughness, and extensive experience. My partner and I have had the opportunity to handle several cases with Ms. Lamarre over the years, and it is reassuring to know that we can count on her to highlight the various relevant legal aspects and advise us accordingly. She leaves no stone unturned to ensure nothing is overlooked.\nIf only all professionals were this conscientious…",
        "time": 1611357253,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Suzanne Paquet",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105007188987563046694/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKGJJ5LmQ_N30UCmcrjWoCZVj-PhVDdXOjV-pTSuKMmg4gt4Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Ms. Lamarre, thank you for your kindness!\nMs. Lamarre is a warm and attentive notary who was able to thoroughly explain the ins and outs of the situation that a difficult period of grief can bring.\nProfessional, she answered many of our questions before I even needed to verbalize them, and, gifted with empathy, she was able to guide us through the steps to take and how to proceed.\nVery well-known in our region, she enjoys an excellent reputation, among other things, for her integrity, honesty, and duty to her clients.\nAfter personally using her expertise, I must confirm that her legal services are unparalleled!",
        "time": 1673462874,
        "translated": true
      }
